      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start, but could you expand a bit more on the pros? specifically how the revenue generation might help stabilize the economy or support new industries. it'll help me feel more confident about the positive outlook in the brief. like, can you go a bit deeper into the benefits/opportunities side of things? just keep it professional though.",
